    schema:title "Associate Director, Head of High Throughput Lab" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/flagshippioneeringinc/associate-director-head-of-high-throughput-lab-cambridge-427787> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-associate-partner-ai-data-life-sciences-berlin-62207> a prov:Entity,
