    schema:title "Director, Medical Strategy (Medical Affairs)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/realchemistry/director-medical-strategy-medical-affairs-93950> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-director-of-compliance-and-risk-uk-london-355629> a prov:Entity,
