    schema:title "New Patient Nurse" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/montu-uk/new-patient-nurse-winnersh-29212> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-onboarding-executive-london-85935> a prov:Entity,
