    schema:description "Deine Aufgaben The Online Sales team is in charge of the growth and success of our digital presence, optimising marketing channels across all regions. We ensure a seamless, impactful experience that resonates with customers. Through our dedication and innovation, we unlock untapped potential, drive impressive growth, and set ambitious goals, shaping the future of O’Donnell’s online business. Starting 01.10.2026, we are looking for you as a Performance Marketing Working Student (f/m/d)! You create and optimise ads across Meta, Google, and Amazon You develop weekly reports based on the creative performance of previous periods You brainstorm ideas for top-performing paid social ads and test your hypotheses directly in the Meta Ads Manager Dein Profil You are currently studying for a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Marketing, Communications, or a related field You have a foundational understanding of digital marketing principles, paid advertising, and the different funnel stages and their applications You bring some initial experience with Meta Ads, Google Ads, or Amazon Ads (entry-level) You have first experiences managing and optimising Amazon Seller Central You are confident working with numbers and performing KPI analysis using tools like Excel, Google Sheets, or similar You possess German skills at a minimum B1 level and English skills at a C1 level Deine Benefits Grow beyond yourself – look forward to diverse tasks with plenty of responsibility and the opportunity to develop further alongside us Better work-life balance – we offer flexible working hours and the option to work from home Workation – on top of that, you have the opportunity for 10 days of workation per year Hardware – of course, we provide the hardware you need to do your job Fancy a drink? You’ll receive an employee discount on our products, as well as a free 700ml bottle of moonshine for every new flavor launch Community – we value communication at eye level and love to celebrate our successes twice a year at our winter and summer parties. We also promote regular team events Extra Perks – you get access to our Corporate Benefits, and we subsidize your company pension scheme (bAV) by 25% Mobility or Fitness – you can choose between a subsidy for public transport or an Urban Sports Club membership Want to become part of our Moonshine team? Great, we look forward to receiving your application! Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "Entry, Part time, Working student" ;
