    schema:title "Werkstudent:in Business Operations" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/vestigas/remote-werkstudentin-business-operations-munchen-hybrid-253185> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-revenue-operations-intern-wmx-koln-366957> a prov:Entity,
