    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/doctolib/senior-ai-crm-automation-specialist-berlin-berlin-348486> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-ai-specialist-operations-berlin-berlin-278240> a prov:Entity,
