y\">&nbsp;and able to multi-task in a dynamic and often changing environment.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">Our customers use&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">our products to help shape the future of the energy industry, and as such this role offers the opportunity to work&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">with cutting edge technologies,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">collaborate</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">&nbsp;with key players in energy markets, and solve the&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">most fundamental&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">problems</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">&nbsp;facing&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">the energy sector today</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">The</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">&nbsp;role can be based out of our London office, or remote working.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">The role also offers the opportunity for international travel across the Europe, Middle&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">East</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Body\">&nbsp;and Africa regions.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Title 14pt Colour\">Required Knowledge,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Title 14pt Colour\">Skills</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Title 14pt Colour\">&nbsp;and Experience</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:260,&quot;335559739&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <table data-tablestyle=\"Custom\" data-tablelook=\"0\"> <tbody> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table Header\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;f7e8c146-7ee4-5887-b5cd-59e7b306cda5|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469777841,&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,469769226,&quot;Century Gothic,Times New Roman&quot;,335551500,&quot;0&quot;,268442635,&quot;18&quot;,335559685,&quot;0&quot;,201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,335559705,&quot;3081&quot;,335559739,&quot;60&quot;,335559738,&quot;60&quot;,469775450,&quot;SAW-Table Header&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134234082,&quot;true&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;SAW-TableHeader&quot;,335572020,&quot;99&quot;,469778324,&quot;SAW-Table Body&quot;]}\">KNOWLEDGE AND SKILLS</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Knowledge of&nbsp;electricity markets&nbsp;and&nbsp;power trading&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience in energy market 