k=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proficient with corporate productivity and web presentation tools</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Excellent verbal and written communications skills</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong listening and presentation skills</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to multi-task, prioritize, and manage time effectively</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Self-driven, results-orientated with a positive outlook and a focus on quality</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Thorough knowledge of standard Microsoft programs – Word, Excel, PowerPoint</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to manage multiple competing priorities</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Sense of urgency for goal achievement</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong desire&nbsp;for personal and career advancement</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">EDUCATION AND EXPERIENCE</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A tertiary degree in Electrical Engineering, Energy Economics, Operations&nbsp;Research&nbsp;or similar degree.&nbsp;&nbsp;Ideally the candidate should have specialisation in Electricity Systems (and/or Markets).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">5-7 years’ experience in&nbsp;energy markets&nbsp;with a strong understanding of energy economics and market fundamentals, energy systems&nbsp;operation&nbsp;and/or engineering</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td data-celllook=\"69905\"> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Knowledge of PLEXOS or other mathematically based optimisation tools</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> <td data-celllook=\"4369\"> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Essential</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:260,&quot;335559739&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p>Energy Exemplar is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all team members. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, experiences, identities, and abilities. Please let us know if you require accommodations at any stage of the recruitment process—we're here to support you in showcasing your full potential.</p> <p><em>Energy Exemplar respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal data you share during the recruitment process. This Candidate <a>Privacy Notice</a> explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you apply for a role with us.</em></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
