    schema:title "Senior Quality Analyst" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/starrez/senior-quality-analyst-330064> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-quality-assurance-engineer-hamburg-23520> a prov:Entity,
