            schema:name "Heikendorf (bei Kiel)" ] ;
    schema:title "Werkstudent Foodservice | Robotic Kitchens (all genders welcome)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/goodbytz/werkstudent-foodservice-robotic-kitchens-all-genders-welcome-heikendorf-bei-kiel-344279> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudent-munchen-314313> a prov:Entity,
