    schema:title "Werkstudent:in Finance & Accounting" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/vestigas/werkstudentin-finance-accounting-munchen-hybrid-90379> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudentin-innovation-management-berlin-298599> a prov:Entity,
