            schema:name "Berlin" ] ;
    schema:title "Working Student Content & Brand (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sunpeak-capital/working-student-content-brand-berlin-227902> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-working-student-growth-operations-content-management-hamburg-390763> a prov:Entity,
